  "summary": "Intesis 700 Series gateway on the XYE bus of Bosch commercial / VRF systems serving Modbus RTU and TCP. Each unit index gets a 100-register block with on/off, mode, setpoint, fan, vanes, room temperature, errors and locks; low addresses hold all-unit commands.",
